invariant: INV-14
file: quic_config.c
catches: quic_driver_test
reason: quic_config_ok takes an empty PSK identity, which RFC 9846 section
  4.3.11 does not allow, so ch_quic_init stages a ClientHello every server
  must refuse. bin/quic_driver_test requires CH_EINVAL and nothing staged
  for an identity of 0 bytes.

--- old
    return len >= 1 && len <= CH_TICKET_ID_MAX;
--- new
    return len <= CH_TICKET_ID_MAX;
